{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"terraform","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"Terraform and HCL","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Terraform and HCL (.tf .tfvars .hcl .tfstate).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"terraform","name":"Terraform and HCL","extensions":[".tf",".tfvars",".hcl",".tfstate"],"grammar":"grammars/terraform.json","lineComment":"#","blockComment":["/*","*/"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Terraform and HCL","path":"snippets/terraform.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/terraform.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\/\\\\*\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\*\\\\/\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\/\\\\/.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"<<EOF\",\n      \"end\": \"<<EOF\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"<<\\\\-EOF\",\n      \"end\": \"<<\\\\-EOF\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"<<EOT\",\n      \"end\": \"<<EOT\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:var|local|module|data|each|count|path|terraform|self)\\\\.[A-Za-z0-9_.\\\\-\\\\[\\\\]*]+\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\$\\\\{|\\\\}\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:required_providers|required_version|provisioner|depends_on|terraform|lifecycle|resource|variable|provider|for_each|backend|dynamic|content|output|locals|module|import|count|moved|check|data)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true|null)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:string|number|object|tuple|bool|list|map|set|any)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:templatefile|jsonencode|jsondecode|cidrsubnet|trimspace|element|replace|format|lookup|length|concat|values|tolist|split|merge|toset|tomap|regex|upper|lower|file|join|keys)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/terraform.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Resource\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"res\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"resource \\\"${1:aws_instance}\\\" \\\"${2:name}\\\" {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A resource\"\n  },\n  \"Variable\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"var\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"variable \\\"${1:name}\\\" {\",\n      \"\\ttype        = ${2:string}\",\n      \"\\tdescription = \\\"${3}\\\"\",\n      \"\\tdefault     = ${4:null}\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A variable\"\n  },\n  \"Output\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"out\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"output \\\"${1:name}\\\" {\",\n      \"\\tvalue = ${2:aws_instance.name.id}\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An output\"\n  },\n  \"Provider\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"prov\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"provider \\\"${1:aws}\\\" {\",\n      \"\\tregion = \\\"${2:eu-west-1}\\\"\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A provider\"\n  },\n  \"Module\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"mod\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"module \\\"${1:name}\\\" {\",\n      \"\\tsource = \\\"${2:./modules/name}\\\"\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A module call\"\n  },\n  \"Data source\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"data\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"data \\\"${1:aws_ami}\\\" \\\"${2:name}\\\" {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A data source\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Terraform and HCL\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Terraform and HCL.\n\n## Files\n\n`.tf`, `.tfvars`, `.hcl`, `.tfstate`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `#`.\n- 6 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `res` | A resource |\n| `var` | A variable |\n| `out` | An output |\n| `prov` | A provider |\n| `mod` | A module call |\n| `data` | A data source |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}